    "name": "Enterprise Retail Management & AI Intelligence API",
    "description": "Comprehensive REST API collection for Enterprise Retail Management, Inventory Control & AI Demand Intelligence. Supports RBAC (Admin, Manager, Cashier, Inventory Staff), JWT authentication, multi-warehouse inventory, procurement, POS billing, and AI forecasting.",
